:null,"checks":{}},"modelingNotes":["The original curved OSM tower outline, orientation, 59-level tag and 210 m overall height are retained. No independently mapped building parts exist in this packet.","The 2005 oblique skyline photograph and opposite distant view show the original straight-sided glazed slab, vertical ribs and shallow recessed top. Body eave 206 m, rooftop setbacks and terrace detailing are explicit visual inferences.","Structural glass uses the approved light-blue palette instead of the historic dark tint. Grey vertical ribs and 29 double-floor bands preserve the facade rhythm within the map-scale budget; individual offices, roof equipment and signage are omitted.","The model depicts the historic exterior seen in the selected references. It does not represent proposed renovations or certify current construction status."],"source":{"url":"/assets/tour-montparnasse/c6b0a0e67f70ecad8aab9db48ca0beb807f5f14310d0c884256928968de8cc6f/source.blend.gz","bytes":155236,"sha256":"affc986fd312686746bee2c6baaced56f986d8fbf0c8e3a6da2bfb41430bb1ce"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/assets/tour-montparnasse/c6b0a0e67f70ecad8aab9db48ca0beb807f5f14310d0c884256928968de8cc6f/spatial-source.json","bytes":4497,"sha256":"9e703f2739a2d8190c0afe2d689c71b0127472d05936a344268346165164a8d6"},"preview":{"url":"/assets/tour-montparnasse/c6b0a0e67f70ecad8aab9db48ca0beb807f5f14310d0c884256928968de8cc6f/preview.webp","bytes":5238,"sha256":"14d308a5181ce35457dce4e7783062ade4e4f88d1ee11c3b50b65d04ace5fcb6"},"revision":"5e56e6fdc16c3fb96294ba66fd239fd5a1b6c697e7cb9b497644eb947b3507fa","publicationRevision":"c6b0a0e67f70ecad8aab9db48ca0beb807f5f14310d0c884256928968de8cc6f","bounds":[2.3215795,48.841824,2.3223797,48.8424015],"approved":false,"metadata":"/assets/tour-montparnasse/c6b0a0e67f70ecad8aab9db48ca0beb807f5f14310d0c884256928968de8cc6f/asset.json","validation":"/assets/tour-montparnasse/c6b0a0e67f70ecad8aab9db48ca0beb807f5f14310d0c884256928968de8cc6f/validation.json"}